  "description": "***First time to the rental market***\n\n***Available from mid October 2026***\n\nThe Lodge is a beautifully presented two-bedroom country home, set within the peaceful surroundings of a 73-acre farm in the heart of West Cork.\n\nRecently converted and renovated, the house has been finished with care to create a fresh, comfortable and welcoming home, combining modern living with the peace and space of a countryside setting.\n\nAccommodation includes two bedrooms (1 double and 1 king), a newly fitted kitchen, bright open-plan living area, main bathroom, separate downstairs WC, and brand new furniture and flooring throughout. \n\nThe Lodge offers the best of both worlds - a manageable, modern home surrounded by open countryside, while remaining within easy reach of Dunmanway and the wider West Cork area.\n\nThe property would particularly suit someone looking for a peaceful, well-cared-for long-term home and who will appreciate the unique rural setting.\n\nTo register your interest, please email with  information about yourself, including who would be living at the property, your current circumstances and your preferred move-in date. \n\nThe property is strictly non-smoking.\n\nReferences will be required.\n\nPlease note that the surrounding farmland is not included in the tenancy.\n\nThe property is in a rural location, approximately 12 km from Dunmanway town, so a car is essential.",
